<title>UK: J.P. Morgan leads $436.5 mln issue for CRAVE Trust.</title>
<headline>J.P. Morgan leads $436.5 mln issue for CRAVE Trust.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.P. Morgan has lead-managed a $436.5 million issue of 144a eligible notes for CRAVE Trust 1996-403, rated A2 by Moody's and A by S&amp;P.</p>
<p>The deal is all sold. -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
